A rhydonium '''refinery''' was located on the [[jungle]] [[planet]] [[Morak]]. It was operated by [[Morak Imperial remnants|Imperial remnants]] led by ex-[[Imperial Security Bureau]] personnel.<ref name="Chapter 15" /> In [[9 ABY]]<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|15|the appearance of the [[Morak]] Imperial refinery}}</ref> the refinery was infiltrated by [[Din Djarin]] and [[Migs Mayfeld]] posing as [[Juggernaut Pilot]]s to retrieve information on [[Moff]] [[Gideon]]'s [[Gideon's light cruiser|light cruiser]]. During their escape, Mayfeld fired on a shipment of rhydonium, causing a chain reaction that heavily damaged the refinery. It was also a base of operations to [[Valin Hess]], an ex-Imperial general.<ref name="Chapter 15" />

